id=vpnhide_kpm
name=VPN Hide (KPM)
version=v0.7.1
versionCode=701
author=okhsunrog
description=Hides VPN interfaces from selected apps at the kernel level via a KernelPatch Module (KPM). Single cross-version binary for kernels the .ko backend can't serve (non-GKI / no headers / module signing). Loaded by the KernelPatch runtime. Manage targets via VPN Hide app.
